<title>NETHERLANDS: VASTNED RETAIL H1 NET RISES 6.6 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>VASTNED RETAIL H1 NET RISES 6.6 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Direct inv result (net profit)  30.7  vs  28.8</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)	 3.97 vs   3.89</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (guilders) 102.12 vs 104.21</p>
<p>    Net rental income		   44.7  vs  43.6</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.5  vs   1.0</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    12.1  vs  12.9</p>
<p>    General costs			  0.9  vs   0.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Property fund VastNed Retail NV said in April it</p>
<p>expected 1996 earnings per share to remain steady.</p>
</text>
